      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brooklyn_Center%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1969, both Brooklyn Center and Brooklyn Park renamed Osseo Road to Brooklyn Boulevard, honoring the area’s heritage.",
